  "_note": "The grid. Spine up the plaza at x=114 from the power room (z119) to the freezer (z152), with spurs to the barracks Heater (111,137), the laboratory interior for the Hi-Tech research bench, the kitchen, and along z=151 under the freezer's north wall to both Cooler cells at (118,152) and (122,152). Conduits may share a cell with a wall, which is how each spur crosses a building's shell without a hole."
